FORMAT: 1A

# 用户文件系统 API

用户文件系统 API 提供对用户私有文件系统的完整操作能力，包括文件和目录的创建、删除、移动、复制等操作。

所有端点需要通过 Bearer Token 进行身份认证。

# Group 目录操作

目录的列出和创建操作。

## 列出目录 [/file_system/list]

列出指定目录下的所有条目。

### 列出目录内容 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "entries": [
                {
                    "name": "report.pdf",
                    "path": "/documents/report.pdf",
                    "is_dir": false,
                    "st_mode": 33188,
                    "st_ino": 12345,
                    "st_dev": 1,
                    "st_nlink": 1,
                    "st_uid": 1000,
                    "st_gid": 1000,
                    "st_size": 1024,
                    "st_atime": 1704067200.0,
                    "st_mtime": 1704067200.0,
                    "st_ctime": 1704067200.0
                },
                {
                    "name": "projects",
                    "path": "/documents/projects",
                    "is_dir": true,
                    "st_mode": 16877,
                    "st_ino": 12346,
                    "st_dev": 1,
                    "st_nlink": 2,
                    "st_uid": 1000,
                    "st_gid": 1000,
                    "st_size": 0,
                    "st_atime": 1704067200.0,
                    "st_mtime": 1704067200.0,
                    "st_ctime": 1704067200.0
                }
            ]
        }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "目录不存在: /documents"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 创建目录 [/file_system/mkdir]

创建指定路径的目录，支持递归创建父目录。

### 创建目录 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents/projects/new_project",
            "exist_ok": true
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "path": "/documents/projects/new_project"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "目录已存在: /documents/projects/new_project"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

# Group 文件操作

文件的下载和上传操作。

## 下载文件 [/file_system/download]

以流式响应方式下载文件。

### 下载文件 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/octet-stream)

    + Headers

            Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="notes.txt"

    + Body

            文件二进制内容

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "文件不存在: /documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 上传文件 [/file_system/upload{?path}]

上传文件到指定路径。

+ Parameters
    + path (string) - 目标文件路径

### 上传文件 [POST]

+ Request (multipart/form-data)

        Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

        ------WebKitFormBoundary
        Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="example.txt"
        Content-Type: text/plain

        文件内容
        ------WebKitFormBoundary--

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "path": "/documents/example.txt",
            "bytes_written": 1024
        }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "上传文件失败"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

# Group 查询操作

文件系统路径的查询操作。

## 检查存在 [/file_system/exists]

检查指定路径是否存在。

### 检查路径是否存在 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "exists": true,
            "is_dir": false,
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "exists": false,
            "path": "/nonexistent"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 获取状态 [/file_system/stat]

获取文件或目录的详细状态信息。

### 获取状态信息 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "name": "notes.txt",
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt",
            "is_dir": false,
            "st_mode": 33188,
            "st_ino": 12345,
            "st_dev": 1,
            "st_nlink": 1,
            "st_uid": 1000,
            "st_gid": 1000,
            "st_size": 1024,
            "st_atime": 1704067200.0,
            "st_mtime": 1704067200.0,
            "st_ctime": 1704067200.0
        }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "路径不存在: /documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

# Group 管理操作

文件和目录的移动、复制和删除操作。

## 移动/重命名 [/file_system/move]

移动或重命名文件或目录。

### 移动文件或目录 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "source": "/documents/old_name.txt",
            "destination": "/documents/new_name.txt"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "source": "/documents/old_name.txt",
            "destination": "/documents/new_name.txt"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "目录 'sys' 是系统初始目录，禁止此操作"
        }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "源路径不存在: /documents/old_name.txt"
        }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "移动失败"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 复制 [/file_system/copy]

复制（克隆）文件或目录到新位置。

### 复制文件或目录 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "source": "/documents/original.txt",
            "destination": "/documents/copy.txt"
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "source": "/documents/original.txt",
            "destination": "/documents/copy.txt"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "目录 'pub' 是系统初始目录，禁止此操作"
        }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "源路径不存在: /documents/original.txt"
        }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "复制失败"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

## 删除 [/file_system/delete]

删除文件或目录。

### 删除文件或目录 [POST]

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt",
            "recursive": false
        }

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "path": "/documents/projects",
            "recursive": true
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "path": "/documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "目录非空，需要递归删除: /documents/projects"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "目录 'priv' 是系统初始目录，禁止此操作"
        }

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "路径不存在: /documents/notes.txt"
        }

+ Response 500 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "删除失败"
        }

+ Response 504 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "操作超时"
        }

# Data Structures

## FileInfo (object)
文件/目录完整信息，包含所有状态属性。StatResponse 是此模型的别名。

+ name: `notes.txt` (string) - 文件名
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 完整路径
+ is_dir: false (boolean) - 是否为目录
+ st_mode: 33188 (number) - 文件权限模式
+ st_ino: 12345 (number) - inode 号
+ st_dev: 1 (number) - 设备号
+ st_nlink: 1 (number) - 硬链接数
+ st_uid: 1000 (number) - 用户 ID
+ st_gid: 1000 (number) - 组 ID
+ st_size: 1024 (number) - 文件大小（字节）
+ st_atime: 1704067200.0 (number) - 最后访问时间（时间戳）
+ st_mtime: 1704067200.0 (number) - 最后修改时间（时间戳）
+ st_ctime: 1704067200.0 (number) - 创建时间（时间戳）

## ListDirRequest (object)
+ path: `/documents` (string) - 目录路径

## ListDirResponse (object)
+ entries (array[FileInfo]) - 目录条目列表

## CreateDirRequest (object)
+ path: `/documents/projects` (string) - 目录路径
+ exist_ok: false (boolean, optional) - 目录已存在时是否忽略，默认 false

## CreateDirResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ path: `/documents/projects` (string) - 创建的目录路径

## DownloadRequest (object)
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 文件路径

## UploadResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ path: `/documents/uploaded.txt` (string) - 文件路径
+ bytes_written: 2048 (number) - 写入的字节数

## ExistsRequest (object)
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 路径

## ExistsResponse (object)
+ exists: true (boolean) - 是否存在
+ is_dir: false (boolean, optional) - 是否为目录（仅存在时有效）
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 检查的路径

## StatRequest (object)
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 路径

## MoveRequest (object)
+ source: `/documents/old.txt` (string) - 源路径
+ destination: `/documents/new.txt` (string) - 目标路径

## MoveResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ source: `/documents/old.txt` (string) - 源路径
+ destination: `/documents/new.txt` (string) - 目标路径

## CopyRequest (object)
+ source: `/documents/original.txt` (string) - 源路径
+ destination: `/documents/copy.txt` (string) - 目标路径

## CopyResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ source: `/documents/original.txt` (string) - 源路径
+ destination: `/documents/copy.txt` (string) - 目标路径

## DeleteRequest (object)
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 要删除的路径
+ recursive: false (boolean, optional) - 是否递归删除目录，默认 false

## DeleteResponse (object)
+ success: true (boolean) - 是否成功
+ path: `/documents/notes.txt` (string) - 删除的路径

## Error (object)
+ detail: `错误描述` (string) - 错误详情